LIBRARY dmwhook

EXETYPE WINDOWS

DESCRIPTION 'Mouse Hook'

CODE	  PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA	  PRELOAD MOVEABLE SINGLE

HEAPSIZE  1024


EXPORTS
    WEP 		                                @1 RESIDENTNAME
    ?MouseFunc@@ZCHHGK@Z                                @2
    ?CheckWindow@@ZCXIH@Z                               @3
    ?InstallFilter@@ZCXHH@Z                             @4
    ?AvoidActivation@@ZCXIH@Z                           @5
    ?InstallDestroyServer@@ZCXIHI@Z                     @6
    ?WatchCreate@@ZCXHPED0I@Z                           @7
